  <text xml:base="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0428.adelon_dramaton.meineke1839-grc1" xml:lang="grc"><body n="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0428.adelon_dramaton.meineke1839-grc1" xml:lang="grc"><div type="edition" n="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0428.adelon_dramaton.meineke1839-grc1" xml:lang="grc" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0428_adelon_dramaton"><head>ΑΔΗΛΩΝ ΔΡΑΜΑΤΩΝ</head><div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="i" ana="#compiled-citation-normalized" xml:id="meineke-0428-adelon_dramaton-i">
              <lg>
                <l n="1" xml:id="meineke-0428-adelon_dramaton-i-l1">Οὐκοῦν ἀκρατισώμεθ᾽ αὐτοῦ. <sp>
                    <speaker>Β.</speaker> μηδαμῶς·</sp>
                </l>
                <l n="2" xml:id="meineke-0428-adelon_dramaton-i-l2">Ἰσθμῷ γὰρ ἀριστήσομεν.</l>
              </lg>
              <pb n="837" facs="urn:hathi:hvd.hxjhbd:scan:855" />
              <note type="source">Athenaeus I p. 11 c. de verbo ἀκρατίζεσθαι poetarum testimonia afferens: καὶ Κάνθαρος Οὐκοῦν κτλ.</note>
              <note type="apparatus">Vs. 1 in V ita scriptus legitur: οὔκουν ἀκρατισόμεθα ἀντὶ τοῦ μηδαμῶς. Recte locum scriptum exhibet L. — Vs. 2 vulgo ἐν Ἰσθμῷ. Correxit Iacobsius Addit. ad Athen. p. 8.</note>
            </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="ii" author_heading="Cantharus" work_heading="Ex incertis fabulis" starts_on_page="837" ends_on_page="837" ana="#compiled-citation-normalized" xml:id="meineke-0428-adelon_dramaton-ii">
              <note type="source">Phrynichus App. Sophist. p. 50 5. Λέκιθος: ἐπὶ τοῦ κρόκου τοῦ ᾠοῦ ἰατροὶ λέγουσι, Κάνθαρος δὲ οὕτως ἀληλεσμένον τι ἐξ ὀσπρίων.</note>
            </div>
            <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="iii" author_heading="Cantharus" work_heading="Ex incertis fabulis" starts_on_page="837" ends_on_page="837" ana="#compiled-citation-normalized" xml:id="meineke-0428-adelon_dramaton-iii">
              <note type="source">Pollux IV 61: τὸ δὲ (ψιθύρα) ἦν πλινθεῖον πηχυαῖον, ἔχον διειλκυσμένα πηνία, ἃ περιστρεφόμενα ἦχον ἐποίει κροτάλῳ παραπλήσιον. μάγαδιν μὲν ὀνομάζει Ἀνακρέων, τὴν δὲ εὕρεσιν αὐτῆς Κάνθαρος Θραξὶ προστίθησιν.</note>
              <note type="apparatus">Fortasse ad Tereum haec referenda sunt.</note>
            </div>
          </div></body></text></TEI>